{
    "title": "UV Index - Tan Widget",
    "description": "Thanks to our Digital UV Index application using the best weather data, accurately measure the UV index wherever you are. Protect your skin by monitoring the UV index to avoid sunburn and reduce the risk of cancer. Use our practical widget to have essential information directly on your home screen, guaranteeing maximum safety during your sun exposure.\r\n\r\nBased on the Fitzpatrick scale, which classifies individuals according to the reaction of their skin to sun exposure, you can choose your skin type. This will give you personalized values regarding your maximum exposure to the sun before burning. Create UV index alerts for each location so you know when to seek shade or to remind your loved ones to reapply sunscreen. Accurate weather forecasts take into account cloud cover to inform you of solar exposure conditions in real time.\r\n\r\nWith our new update, add up to 6 locations to compare the UV indices of each of them. The app takes altitude into account in its calculations, ideal for planning mountain activities like hiking and skiing without the risk of burning your skin. Enjoy the benefits of vitamin D while minimizing the risks to your skin with detailed forecasts and real-time alerts.\r\n\r\nReceive daily morning notifications informing you of the UV index intensity for the day, helping you to be best prepared. Our handy UV widget lets you track the UV index at a glance, right on your home screen. Maximize your tan safely, avoiding burns and taking care of your skin.\r\n\r\nThe app takes weather and cloud cover into account to provide you with accurate, up-to-date solar exposure information. Whether you are at the beach, in the mountains or in your garden, our application helps you enjoy the sun safely. Monitoring the UV index is essential to prevent the risk of burns and guarantee maximum safety during your sun exposure.\r\n\r\nDownload now and turn your smartphone into a powerful UV index and sun protection tool. If you like our app, don't forget to rate it and share your experience with your friends and family. Encourage everyone to enjoy the sun without risking their health, while optimizing the benefits of vitamin D.\r\n\r\nEnjoy every sunny moment worry-free with our app. Whether for an optimal tan or simply to benefit from the benefits of vitamin D, our application guides you for healthy and safe sun exposure. With our practical widget, stay constantly informed of the UV index of your location and take care of your skin.\r\n\r\nOur application is designed to offer you maximum safety during your exposure to the sun. By monitoring the UV index and providing you with accurate weather forecasts, you can avoid the risk of burns and the dangers associated with excessive sun exposure. Keep your skin protected and enjoy the sun with complete peace of mind. Detailed alerts and forecasts ensure you always know when to go out in the sun and when to protect yourself.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to rate the app if you like it! Your feedback is valuable to help us continually improve our services and offer you the best possible experience. Share your experience and encourage your loved ones to adopt healthy sun exposure habits thanks to our innovative application",
    "descriptionHTML": "Thanks to our Digital UV Index application using the best weather data, accurately measure the UV index wherever you are. Protect your skin by monitoring the UV index to avoid sunburn and reduce the risk of cancer. Use our practical widget to have essential information directly on your home screen, guaranteeing maximum safety during your sun exposure.<br><br>Based on the Fitzpatrick scale, which classifies individuals according to the reaction of their skin to sun exposure, you can choose your skin type. This will give you personalized values regarding your maximum exposure to the sun before burning. Create UV index alerts for each location so you know when to seek shade or to remind your loved ones to reapply sunscreen. Accurate weather forecasts take into account cloud cover to inform you of solar exposure conditions in real time.<br><br>With our new update, add up to 6 locations to compare the UV indices of each of them. The app takes altitude into account in its calculations, ideal for planning mountain activities like hiking and skiing without the risk of burning your skin. Enjoy the benefits of vitamin D while minimizing the risks to your skin with detailed forecasts and real-time alerts.<br><br>Receive daily morning notifications informing you of the UV index intensity for the day, helping you to be best prepared. Our handy UV widget lets you track the UV index at a glance, right on your home screen. Maximize your tan safely, avoiding burns and taking care of your skin.<br><br>The app takes weather and cloud cover into account to provide you with accurate, up-to-date solar exposure information. Whether you are at the beach, in the mountains or in your garden, our application helps you enjoy the sun safely. Monitoring the UV index is essential to prevent the risk of burns and guarantee maximum safety during your sun exposure.<br><br>Download now and turn your smartphone into a powerful UV index and sun protection tool. If you like our app, don&#39;t forget to rate it and share your experience with your friends and family. Encourage everyone to enjoy the sun without risking their health, while optimizing the benefits of vitamin D.<br><br>Enjoy every sunny moment worry-free with our app. Whether for an optimal tan or simply to benefit from the benefits of vitamin D, our application guides you for healthy and safe sun exposure. With our practical widget, stay constantly informed of the UV index of your location and take care of your skin.<br><br>Our application is designed to offer you maximum safety during your exposure to the sun. By monitoring the UV index and providing you with accurate weather forecasts, you can avoid the risk of burns and the dangers associated with excessive sun exposure. Keep your skin protected and enjoy the sun with complete peace of mind. Detailed alerts and forecasts ensure you always know when to go out in the sun and when to protect yourself.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to rate the app if you like it! Your feedback is valuable to help us continually improve our services and offer you the best possible experience. Share your experience and encourage your loved ones to adopt healthy sun exposure habits thanks to our innovative application",
